   "changes": "Only the List interface is asked for and tested. The tests call run(ops), which the starter defines: it applies each operation to a new ArrayList and returns what get and size return.",
   "prompt": "From scratch, write and test implementations of the List, USet and SSet interfaces. These do not have to be efficient. They can be used later to test the correctness and performance of more efficient implementations. (The easiest way to do this is to store the elements in an array.)",
   "answer": {
